lemma q3_gcd_all {x y g d: set} (G: hyps):
  $ G ⇒ ∀ x (x ∊ ω → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) $
----
o1: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω ⇒ x ∊ ω $ by ax
o2: $ … ⇒ ∅ ∈ x ∨ ∅ = x $ by omega_zero_le [o1]
a1: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ = x ⇒ ∅ = x $ by ax
a2: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ = x ⇒ v ∊ ω $ by ax
a3: $ … ⇒ ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ndvd g v ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d g)) $ by q3_gcd_zc [a1, a2]
b1: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ ∈ x ⇒ x ∊ ω $ by ax
b2: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ ∈ x ⇒ v ∊ ω $ by ax
b3: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ ∈ x ⇒ ∅ ∈ x $ by ax
