c1: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ ∈ x , u = nmod v x , u ∊ x ⇒ ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) $ by ax
c2: $ … ⇒ u ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g u ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d y → ndvd d g))) $ by all_elim [c1]
c3: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ ∈ x , u = nmod v x , u ∊ x ⇒ u ∊ x $ by ax
c4: $ … ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g u ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d y → ndvd d g))) $ by imp_elim [c2, c3]
c5: $ … ⇒ x ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g u ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d x → ndvd d g)) $ by all_elim [c4]
c6: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ ∈ x , u = nmod v x , u ∊ x ⇒ x ∊ ω $ by ax
c7: $ … ⇒ ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g u ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d x → ndvd d g)) $ by imp_elim [c5, c6]
c8: $ ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g u ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d x → ndvd d g)) ⟺ ∃ w (w ∊ ω ∧ ndvd w u ∧ ndvd w x ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d x → ndvd d w)) $ by ex_alpha
c9: $ G , x ∊ ω , ∀ z (z ∊ x → ∀ y (y ∊ ω → ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g z ∧ ndvd g y ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d z → ndvd d y → ndvd d g)))) , v ∊ ω , ∅ ∈ x , u = nmod v x , u ∊ x ⇒ ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g u ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d x → ndvd d g)) ↔ ∃ w (w ∊ ω ∧ ndvd w u ∧ ndvd w x ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d x → ndvd d w)) $ by weaken [c8]
